                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Actually… decent. This is a HO game. The graphics are okay. The music is average. The story is a simple mash‑up of familiar fairy tales. \n\nNo bugs or crashes.\n\nOverall, entertaining. It’s not much different from the hundreds of games like this—you’ll see all the standard puzzles with minor tweaks. Common mechanics, with a few variants that add a touch of freshness—not much, but some. It’s cheap, includes cards and achievements, and can be finished in one sitting. If you like the genre, you probably won't regret the few hours spent. Probably.",
